--!strict
-- Rooftops2 art pass (vault/01 Design/Maps/Rooftops2.md): dresses the greybox with the Blender kit and
-- applies the map's style by role. Needs the greybox (Greybox.luau) and the kit in
-- ServerStorage.MapKit.Rooftops2 (python tools/studio/maps/kit_bundle.py Rooftops2 Kit). Bundle:
--   python tools/studio/maps/bundle.py Rooftops2 Art Lighting -o rooftops2_art.luau
-- and run it in the match place, edit mode. Re-runnable: every Art section is rebuilt.
--
-- Two generated blocks, never edited here:
--   STYLE  colours / materials / MaterialVariants by role, from tools/maps/rooftops2_style.py --luau
--          (a restyle is: edit that file, regenerate, rerun this bundle; no Blender, no upload);
--   PLACE  what goes where, from tools/maps/rooftops2_art.py (python tools/maps/rooftops2_layout.py --write).
-- Greybox parts whose kit piece is installed are hidden (they stay the collision); the visible ones (roofs,
-- parapets, coping, piers, ledges, sills) are restyled by their Look / Tone attributes.

